  <Document>
    <name>UK Eye Casualty Services</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Green: 24hr walk-in eye casualty<br>Orange: In hours clinics, overnight on call<br>Black: no emergency eye service<br><br>For minor conditions, consider asking the patient to self-refer to the Primary Eyecare Network via https://primaryeyecare.co.uk/. Clinicians can also refer to the Primary Eyecare Network by emailing cnech.pecservices@nhs.net<br><br>This map is being updated to include eye casualty services throughout the UK <br><br>This map was originally created by Jonathan Than at jthan@nhs.net<br><br>For any updates or corrections, contact Ayesha Karimi at ayesha.karimi1@nhs.net<br><br>.]]></description>
