      <Placemark>
        <name>Moorfields Eye Hospital NHS Foundation Trust</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Opening Hours and Cover: 24 hours emergency. Please telephone to discuss whether referral appropriate - full service hospitals may be more appropriate for patients requiring systemic work-up/treatment<br>Telephone: 020 7521 4682 (NUMBER NOT TO BE GIVEN TO PATIENTS)<br>Email: ]]></description>
