      <Placemark>
        <name>Croydon University Hospital</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Opening Hours and Cover: 08:30-16:30 Mon-Fri. Walk-ins/self referrals are NOT accepted. Complete Rapid Access Clinic Referral Form (https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.moorfields.nhs.uk%2FmediaLocal%2Fjoldbq3t%2Fmoorfields-eye-centre-at-croydon-university-hospital-urgent-care-referral-form.docx&wdOrigin=BROWSELINK). Email form to below address. Rapid access clinic is a referral and review by appointment service. Urgent cases requiring same day review please contact the RAC team via the contact number on the referral form, after sending form through (marked URGENT in email subject).<br><br>Out of hours: Covered by St George's Hospital<br><br>Consider referring to local Primary Eyecare services for minor eye conditions - see legend for details.<br><br>For further information regarding referral pathway, please see flowchart at https://drive.google.com/open?id=1CH1uACGug26GuQMbe4GIZ67HutINl8ef&usp=drive_fs<br>Telephone: See Referral Form for further details<br>Email: moorfields.croydonurgentcare@nhs.net]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1643-F57C00-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Opening Hours and Cover">
            <value><![CDATA[08:30-16:30 Mon-Fri. Walk-ins/self referrals are NOT accepted. Complete Rapid Access Clinic Referral Form (https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.moorfields.nhs.uk%2FmediaLocal%2Fjoldbq3t%2Fmoorfields-eye-centre-at-croydon-university-hospital-urgent-care-referral-form.docx&wdOrigin=BROWSELINK). Email form to below address. Rapid access clinic is a referral and review by appointment service. Urgent cases requiring same day review please contact the RAC team via the contact number on the referral form, after sending form through (marked URGENT in email subject).

Out of hours: Covered by St George's Hospital

Consider referring to local Primary Eyecare services for minor eye conditions - see legend for details.

For further information regarding referral pathway, please see flowchart at https://drive.google.com/open?id=1CH1uACGug26GuQMbe4GIZ67HutINl8ef&usp=drive_fs]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Telephone">
            <value>See Referral Form for further details</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Email">
            <value>moorfields.croydonurgentcare@nhs.net</value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
