      <Placemark>
        <name>The Royal London Hospital</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Opening Hours and Cover: No walk-in Eye Casualty at the Royal London Hospital.<br><br>All referrals must be discussed with the Ophthalmologist oncall, and if accepted to attend via the main A&E, unless advised otherwise. Contact is through the main switchboard.<br><br>On-site Ophthalmologist 9am to 5pm available to discuss clinician to clinician referrals.<br><br>No on-site ophthalmologist between 5pm to 9am. The out-of-hours non-resident oncall ophthalmologist can be contacted for clinician to clinician emergency advice and referrals via switchboard.<br>Telephone: 0207 377 7000 (switchboard)<br>Email: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1643-F57C00-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Opening Hours and Cover">
            <value><![CDATA[No walk-in Eye Casualty at the Royal London Hospital.

All referrals must be discussed with the Ophthalmologist oncall, and if accepted to attend via the main A&E, unless advised otherwise. Contact is through the main switchboard.

On-site Ophthalmologist 9am to 5pm available to discuss clinician to clinician referrals.

No on-site ophthalmologist between 5pm to 9am. The out-of-hours non-resident oncall ophthalmologist can be contacted for clinician to clinician emergency advice and referrals via switchboard.]]></value>
